{"id":47402,"date":"2025-12-23T09:40:52","date_gmt":"2025-12-23T08:40:52","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trilhos-herois-sunset-trail\/"},"modified":"2026-09-23T11:01:53","modified_gmt":"2026-09-23T10:01:53","slug":"trilhos-herois-sunset-trail","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trilhos-herois-sunset-trail\/","title":{"rendered":"Trilhos dos Her\u00f3is Sunset Trail 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trilhos dos Her\u00f3is Sunset Trail 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trilhos dos Her\u00f3is Sunset Trail 2026<\/strong> (2\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>26 de setembro de 2026<\/strong>, com concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, partida e chegada no Quartel dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios de Vila Franca das Naves, concelho de Trancoso, distrito da Guarda. Organizado pelo corpo de bombeiros local com cronometragem WAITaSTART, o evento integra oficialmente o Circuito Nacional de Trail (31 km) e o Circuito Nacional de Trail Sprint (19 km) da ATRP.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Sob as cores do crep\u00fasculo da Beira Alta, a prova alia o desafio desportivo \u00e0 solidariedade e ao conv\u00edvio comunit\u00e1rio. As partidas t\u00eam in\u00edcio \u00e0s 15:00 com a Corrida Pequenos Her\u00f3is, seguida da Caminhada dos Her\u00f3is (12 km) \u00e0s 16:00, do Trail dos Super Her\u00f3is (31 km com 1.000m D+) \u00e0s 16:30 e do Trail dos Her\u00f3is (19 km com 650m D+) \u00e0s 17:00. O regulamento estipula uso obrigat\u00f3rio de lanterna frontal, telem\u00f3vel e manta t\u00e9rmica.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">26 de Setembro de 2026<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-siz